.coverage
coverage.xml
htmlcov/

# Downloaded CI artifacts. `upload-artifact` roots them at `data/`, so an
# extracted collector artifact lands as ./logs/ and ./collector/ rather than
# under the gitignored data/. One `git add -A` from committing quote data.
/logs/
/collector/
